          "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> An object <MATH_0002> of the category <MATH_0003> is called\nan <TEXTITOPEN_0001>initial<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> object if for every object <MATH_0004> of <MATH_0005>\nthere is exactly one morphism <MATH_0006>.\n<STRUCT_0003> An object <MATH_0007> of the category <MATH_0008> is called\na <TEXTITOPEN_0002>final<TEXTITCLOSE_0002> object if for every object <MATH_0009> of <MATH_0010>\nthere is exactly one morphism <MATH_0011>.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n",
          "source_text_hash": "sha256:cb9ea5cd788486ffe221dfa1bbdfcb3764aa9d9908371c13c9bdd62d8a564cc6",
          "unit_id": "tag:002C:statement"
